  "details": "When launching VRChat in standalone mode on the PICO 4 Ultra and turning off headset tracking (setting it to 3DoF mode), the mirror function ceases to work properly. While objects appear to be reflected in the mirror, it seems to be set to an unknown distant viewpoint. This issue occurs with both the world mirror and personal mirror, but does not happen with the face mirror. Additionally, this symptom does not occur when using PCVR with SteamVR.\n\nThe PICO OS version is 5.14.5.U.\n\n(This text may be awkward as it was translated using DeepL.)",
